          "returnType": "boolean",
          "description": "Deliver a surface event to whatever the input pipeline subscribed. Takes the event's data alone, which is what survives a postMessage; the suppression calls are supplied here. Returns whether the engine asked for the host's default handling of this event to be suppressed. Across a worker boundary that answer necessarily arrives after the host's own event has finished dispatching, so it informs the host's policy for later events rather than cancelling this one."
        },
